#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_app_architecture.html.heex:230
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A neighbor in round 812 orders 3 liters of milk and taps “Save the order”. Mleko calls `insertValue` for the collection `orders`. Here is what that call goes through and how it reaches another neighbor who has the same round open on their phone."
msgstr "Komšinica u turi 812 poruči 3 litra mleka i dodirne „Sačuvaj porudžbinu“. Mleko pozove `insertValue` za kolekciju `orders`. Evo kroz šta taj poziv prolazi i kako stiže komšiji koji ima istu turu otvorenu na svom telefonu."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_app_architecture.html.heex:284
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A neighbor orders"
msgstr "Komšinica poručuje"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/help_guides.ex:627
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A neighbor · not a member"
msgstr "Komšija · nije član"

