#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A new app value"
msgstr "Nova vrednost aplikacije"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:266
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A person and a role"
msgstr "Osoba i uloga"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:954
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A poll says which roles vote, and which see the results and the details."
msgstr "Glasanje kaže koje uloge glasaju, a koje vide rezultate i pojedinosti."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:960
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A process asks a role by a form or a decision, and sends it a push, if it may mention roles."
msgstr "Proces pita ulogu formom ili odlukom, i šalje joj push, ako sme da pominje uloge."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:841
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A process talks to another process only by a step drawn for it, a call or a signal. What a process writes, a message or a sub-group, starts no process, so two processes cannot spin in a circle by accident."
msgstr "Proces razgovara s drugim procesom samo korakom nacrtanim za to, pozivom ili signalom. Ono što proces napiše, poruka ili podgrupa, ne pokreće nijedan proces, pa se dva procesa ne mogu slučajno vrteti u krug."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile is a member of a group and holds assignments of roles in it. A group has at most one manifest of its own, and a manifest holds roles with lists of what they allow and deny. An assignment and a role are joined only by the role's key."
msgstr "Profil je član grupe i drži dodele uloga u njoj. Grupa ima najviše jedan svoj manifest, a manifest sadrži uloge sa listama dozvola i zabrana. Dodelu i ulogu spaja samo ključ uloge."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/help_guides.ex:681
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile you set"
msgstr "Podešen profil"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_app_architecture.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A project from the %{c1} template builds into one file, %{c2}, which is uploaded into a group's description marked as an app. For every viewer Potok puts a frame together: its own head with the SDK and the styles, and the uploaded HTML in the body."
msgstr "Projekat iz šablona %{c1} se gradi u jedan fajl %{c2}, koji se otprema u opis grupe označen kao aplikacija. Potok za svakog gledaoca sastavi okvir: svoje zaglavlje sa SDK-om i stilom, a u telu otpremljeni HTML."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:162
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A role assignment is a record of the group in which the profile is a member, and a role is a record of a manifest, which may belong to an ancestor. Only the role's key joins them, so an assignment of a role the manifest in force does not have brings nothing. The role Everyone is assigned to nobody: every member holds it by membership itself."
msgstr "Dodela uloge je zapis grupe u kojoj je profil član, a uloga je zapis manifesta, koji može da pripada i nekom pretku. Spaja ih samo ključ uloge, pa dodela uloge koje u važećem manifestu nema ne donosi ništa. Uloga Svi se nikome ne dodeljuje: drži je svaki član samim članstvom."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:541
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A sequence: a resident starts a fault report from the app, the manager picks an outcome in the app, the report calls the process Repairer, which hands back the entity Termin, and a message arrives in the fault's sub-group."
msgstr "Sekvenca: stanar pokreće prijavu kvara iz aplikacije, upravnik bira ishod u aplikaciji, prijava zove proces Majstor koji vraća entitet Termin, a poruka stiže u podgrupu kvara."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:853
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A tree of groups: the public process Repairer in Zgrada Cvetna 12 is called by processes of the group above and of the group below, but not of the neighboring building. A message a process writes does not start another process."
msgstr "Stablo grupa: javan proces Majstor u Zgradi Cvetna 12 zovu procesi grupe iznad i grupe ispod, ali ne i susedne zgrade. Poruka koju proces napiše ne pokreće drugi proces."

