#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every arrow that enters the group goes through the check of permissions, on the app's side and on the processes' side. An app writes only into its own collections and does not read the chat. A process writes as a member, under its own profile, and people answer it in Potok's dialogs and on the Processes tab. The yellow row is one flow through all three columns: an instance waits for a person, Potok counts that, and the app can show it and let the viewer pick an outcome, with no sight of the drawing."
msgstr "Svaka strelica koja ulazi u grupu prolazi proveru dozvola, sa strane aplikacije i sa strane procesa. Aplikacija upisuje samo u svoje kolekcije i ne čita razgovor. Proces upisuje kao član, pod svojim profilom, a ljudi mu odgovaraju u Potokovim dijalozima i na kartici Procesi. Žuti red je isti tok kroz sve tri kolone: instanca čeka osobu, Potok to broji, a aplikacija to može da pokaže i da pusti gledaoca da izabere ishod, bez uvida u crtež."

