#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It writes only into its own collections. It reads other apps' values only outside collections, and another app's collection never."
msgstr "Upisuje samo u svoje kolekcije. Tuđe vrednosti čita samo van kolekcija, a tuđu kolekciju nikad."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:797
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Its maker becomes its first Admin. A new group has no manifest of its own and uses an ancestor's. The exceptions are `.feed` and an app's groups for files, which are made with a manifest of their own, and a sub-group a process makes: its Admins are the people the process names."
msgstr "Tvorac postaje njen prvi Administrator. Nova grupa nema svoj manifest, nego koristi pretkov. Izuzeci su `.feed` i grupe za fajlove aplikacije, koje nastaju sa svojim manifestom, i podgrupa koju napravi proces: njeni Administratori su ljudi koje proces navede."

