#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Potok reads the rules from the settings in the same transaction as the write, so an order after the collection closes does not get through. Links between values, such as `round: 812`, exist only in the data, so what depends on them (a round's deadline, one order per person) Mleko checks itself. The driver ticks what was picked up in a value of their own, so by the `edit_own` rule only they can. The names, numbers and settings are an example."
msgstr "Pravila iz podešavanja Potok čita u istoj transakciji kao i upis, pa porudžbina posle zatvaranja kolekcije ne prolazi. Veze između vrednosti, kao `round: 812`, postoje samo u podacima, pa ono što zavisi od njih (rok ture, jedna porudžbina po osobi) Mleko proverava samo. Vozač čekira preuzeto u svojoj vrednosti, pa to po pravilu `edit_own` može samo on. Imena, brojevi i podešavanja su primer."

