msgid "The example is Zgrada Cvetna 12 from the help, with the processes “Reporting a fault” and “Repairer” (<a1>steps 9 and 10</a1>). One thing is added here: the report is started, and its first outcome picked, by an app in the building's description. In the help that is done on the Processes tab, and the process is the same either way."
msgstr "Primer je Zgrada Cvetna 12 iz pomoći, sa procesima „Prijava kvara“ i „Majstor“ (<a1>koraci 9 i 10</a1>). Jedno je ovde dodato: prijavu pokreće i prvi ishod bira aplikacija u opisu zgrade. U pomoći se to radi na kartici Procesi, a proces je u oba slučaja isti."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:843
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The group deletes its own manifest. Assignments of roles the inherited manifest lacks are deleted, except Admin."
msgstr "Grupa briše svoj manifest. Dodele uloga kojih nasleđeni manifest nema brišu se, osim Administratora."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:852
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The group gets the parent's members with their roles, marked as inherited: all of them, or only those who hold the chosen roles. When it is turned off, the inherited ones become direct and nobody drops out."
msgstr "Grupa dobija članove roditelja sa njihovim ulogama, označene kao nasleđene: sve, ili samo one koji drže izabrane uloge. Kad se isključi, nasleđeni postaju direktni i niko ne ispada."

