#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The group's Admin, except in a direct conversation. The group gets a copy of the manifest in force with the same role keys, so every assignment still holds."
msgstr "Administrator grupe, osim u direktnom razgovoru. Dobija kopiju važećeg manifesta sa istim ključevima uloga, pa sve dodele i dalje važe."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:807
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The group's Admin, only to its members, and only roles of the manifest in force. Everyone is not assigned. The last Admin cannot be taken away, and a role inherited from the parent is taken away in the parent."
msgstr "Administrator grupe, samo njenim članovima, i samo uloge iz važećeg manifesta. Svi se ne dodeljuje. Poslednji Administrator se ne može skinuti, a uloga nasleđena iz roditelja skida se u roditelju."

