#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:410
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The procedure: find the manifest in force; a guest has no permissions; a profile that is not a member has none but the exceptions of a public group; a member holds the role Everyone and the assigned roles the manifest has; Admin has everything; otherwise the permissions are the union of what is allowed minus the union of what is denied."
msgstr "Postupak: nađi važeći manifest; gost nema dozvole; nečlan nema dozvole osim izuzetaka javne grupe; član drži ulogu Svi i dodeljene uloge koje manifest ima; Administrator ima sve; inače dozvole su unija dozvoljenog minus unija zabranjenog."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:781
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The roles the profile holds are in blue."
msgstr "Plavo su uloge koje profil drži."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:185
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The root and the local community have manifests of their own. Zgrada Cvetna 12 and Entrance A use the local community's manifest, and Entrance A also inherits the members of Zgrada 12. Zgrada Cvetna 14 has its own copy of the manifest, and its thread uses it and takes only the participants."
msgstr "Koren i Mesna zajednica imaju svoje manifeste. Zgrada Cvetna 12 i Ulaz A koriste manifest Mesne zajednice, a Ulaz A nasleđuje i članove Zgrade 12. Zgrada Cvetna 14 ima svoju kopiju manifesta, a njena nit ga koristi i uzima samo učesnike."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:1095
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The rules are copied from the <a1>domain map</a1> and from the code."
msgstr "Pravila su prepisana sa <a1>mape domena</a1> i iz koda."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:948
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The rules of an app's collections say which roles write, and which read everything."
msgstr "Pravila kolekcija aplikacije kažu koje uloge pišu, a koje čitaju sve."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:490
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The server checks again"
msgstr "Server ponovo proverava"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:657
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The table is the manifest M1 of the example, which Zgrada Cvetna 12 uses from the local community. Pick a profile or set its roles yourself, then click a field in the table to change what a role does with a permission. The result is worked out by the same rules as in `Access`."
msgstr "Tabela je manifest M1 iz primera, koji Zgrada Cvetna 12 koristi od Mesne zajednice. Izaberi profil ili mu sam podesi uloge, pa klikni na polje u tabeli da promeniš šta uloga radi sa dozvolom. Rezultat se računa istim pravilima kao u `Access`."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_app_architecture.html.heex:764
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The template is the project `potok-vite`, and the example the project `potok-mleko`."
msgstr "Šablon je projekat `potok-vite`, a primer projekat `potok-mleko`."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_app_architecture.html.heex:497
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The write goes down through four checks. The hook lets through only the methods on its list, `AppApi` only the app that is on screen and only while it has tokens, `AppData` only what the collection's rule allows, and the database only the whole transaction, together with the processes that start on that value. After the write PubSub tells every open page of the group, the neighbor's own too, and each decides by itself what its viewer may see, without asking the database. An anonymous value reaches other eyes without its author."
msgstr "Upis ide nadole kroz četiri provere. Hook propušta samo metode sa svog spiska, `AppApi` samo aplikaciju koja je na ekranu i samo dok ima tokena, `AppData` samo ono što pravilo kolekcije dozvoljava, a baza samo celu transakciju, zajedno sa procesima koji kreću na tu vrednost. Posle upisa PubSub javlja svakoj otvorenoj stranici grupe, i komšinicinoj, a svaka sama odlučuje šta njen gledalac sme da vidi, bez pitanja bazi. Anonimna vrednost tuđim očima stiže bez autora."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_app_architecture.html.heex:243
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The write of an order goes down through the app's code, the SDK, the hook on the page, the LiveView, the rules and the database. After the write PubSub tells every page of the group; the neighbor's page with the same app sends the change up into its frame, and a page on another description sends nothing."
msgstr "Upis porudžbine ide nadole kroz kod aplikacije, SDK, hook na stranici, LiveView, pravila i bazu. Posle upisa PubSub javlja svim stranicama grupe; stranica komšije sa istom aplikacijom šalje promenu nagore u njen okvir, a stranica sa drugim opisom ne šalje ništa."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:644
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This is what `Access.for_profile/3` does for one profile in one group. When a list of people with a permission is needed, for example who a notice goes to, the same rule goes into one SQL query (`profile_ids_with_permission/2`), which counts only people and skips the profiles of processes."
msgstr "Ovo radi `Access.for_profile/3` za jedan profil u jednoj grupi. Kad treba lista ljudi sa nekom dozvolom, na primer kome ide obaveštenje, isto pravilo ide u jedan SQL upit (`profile_ids_with_permission/2`), koji broji samo ljude, a profile procesa preskače."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:318
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Thread “Fault: lift”"
msgstr "Nit „Kvar: lift“"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:65
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Three columns: the app in the browser, the group in Potok and the processes on the server. Every link of the app and of the processes with the group goes through the check of permissions, and the app and a process never see each other directly."
msgstr "Tri kolone: aplikacija u pregledaču, grupa u Potoku i procesi na serveru. Sve veze aplikacije i procesa sa grupom prolaze kroz proveru dozvola, a aplikacija i proces se nikad ne vide direktno."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:850
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Turns on “Inherit members”"
msgstr "Uključi „Nasleđuje članove“"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:173
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Two different things are inherited down the tree. A manifest is inherited always and by itself: a group without one uses the manifest of the nearest ancestor that has one. Members are inherited only when a group turns on “Inherit members”, and then it gets all the parent's members with the roles they hold there. Inheriting can be narrowed down to roles: then only the members who hold one of the chosen roles in the parent come in, with all their roles, and whoever loses the last of them leaves."
msgstr "Niz stablo se nasleđuju dve različite stvari. Manifest se nasleđuje uvek i sam od sebe: grupa bez svog koristi manifest najbližeg pretka koji ga ima. Članovi se nasleđuju samo kad grupa uključi „Nasleđuje članove“, i tada dobija sve članove roditelja sa ulogama koje tamo drže. Nasleđivanje može da se suzi na uloge: tada ulaze samo članovi koji u roditelju drže neku od izabranih uloga, sa svim svojim ulogama, a ko izgubi poslednju, izlazi."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:171
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Two inheritances down the tree"
msgstr "Dva nasleđivanja niz stablo"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/help_guides.ex:387
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Values of a profile that is not a member of a public group, where a rule lets it write, in one group across all its apps."
msgstr "Vrednosti nečlana javne grupe, gde ga pravilo pušta da piše, u jednoj grupi kroz sve njene aplikacije."

