#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:870
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Whoever may remove members blocks. A blocked profile does not write, react, vote in a public poll or ask for access, and cannot be invited. A member answers to their roles, so a block also takes them out of the group. An inherited member cannot be blocked here, as their membership comes from the parent."
msgstr "Blokira onaj ko sme da uklanja članove. Blokiran ne piše, ne reaguje, ne glasa u javnom glasanju, ne traži pristup i ne može biti pozvan. Član odgovara svojim ulogama, pa ga blok i izbacuje iz grupe. Nasleđen član se ovde ne može blokirati, jer mu članstvo dolazi iz roditelja."

