#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:926
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "<b>A deleted account</b> leaves its profile as \"Deleted user\", a member of no group and with no role. A group never loses its last Admin, so the person first makes someone else Admin of each group they alone hold."
msgstr "<b>Obrisan nalog</b> ostavlja svoj profil kao „Obrisan korisnik“, bez članstva u ijednoj grupi i bez uloga. Grupa nikad ne ostaje bez poslednjeg Admina, pa osoba prvo nekog drugog postavi za Admina svake grupe koju drži sama."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_app_architecture.html.heex:217
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An app is one HTML file that you upload into the description, on its own or in a ZIP. Potok adds the rest of the frame for every viewer. The frame has no `allow-same-origin`, so it does not see Potok's page, its cookies or the session, and talks to Potok only by messages. When the HTML or the viewer's access (membership, roles) changes, the frame loads again, as an app reads its data once, at the start. A site from another address fits in an app too, in a frame of its own inside this one: the SDK tells it the theme and the language and passes on only the calls the description lists on that frame (`data-potok-api`). It also remembers the page the site's reader is on, so a rebuilt frame opens there, and `?page=` in the group's address names a chapter."
msgstr "Aplikacija je jedan HTML fajl koji otpremiš u opis, sam ili u ZIP-u. Ostatak okvira Potok dodaje za svakog gledaoca. Okvir nema `allow-same-origin`, pa ne vidi Potokovu stranicu, kolačiće ni sesiju, i sa Potokom razgovara samo porukama. Kad se promeni HTML ili pristup gledaoca (članstvo, uloge), okvir se učita ponovo, jer aplikacija svoje podatke čita jednom, na početku. U aplikaciju može da stane i sajt sa druge adrese, u svom okviru unutar ovog: SDK mu javlja temu i jezik i prosleđuje samo pozive koje opis navede na tom okviru (`data-potok-api`). Pamti i stranicu na kojoj je čitalac sajta, pa se okvir napravljen iznova otvara tamo, a `?page=` u adresi grupe imenuje poglavlje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/help_guides.ex:405
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Keys an app keeps in its personal memory for one person, and the most one holds. Only that person reads them; a guest's stay in the browser."
msgstr "Ključevi koje aplikacija čuva u ličnoj memoriji za jednu osobu, i koliko najviše drži jedan. Čita ih samo ta osoba; gostu ostaju u pregledaču."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/help_guides.ex:356
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Personal memory"
msgstr "Lična memorija"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:997
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Repairer is public, so processes of the groups above Zgrada Cvetna 12 and of the groups below it call it. The neighboring branch, Zgrada Cvetna 14, cannot. A private process is called only by its own group. A group field does not leave the group. A signal reaches the groups above and below only where a wait or a start says it hears them, never the neighboring branch, and a call made from a call goes at most %{depth} deep. To a caller from another group the Repairer hands only the Termin and the name of the end it reached. The groups around Zgrada Cvetna 12 and the processes A and B are made up for this picture."
msgstr "Majstor je javan, pa ga zovu procesi grupa iznad Zgrade Cvetna 12 i procesi grupa ispod nje. Susedna grana, Zgrada Cvetna 14, ne može. Privatan proces zove samo njegova grupa. Polje grupe ne izlazi iz grupe. Signal stiže do grupa iznad i ispod samo tamo gde čekanje ili pokretanje kaže da ih čuje, nikad do susedne grane, a poziv iz poziva ide najviše %{depth} u dubinu. Pozivaocu iz druge grupe Majstor predaje samo Termin i ime kraja do kog je stigao. Grupe oko Zgrade Cvetna 12 i procesi A i B izmišljeni su za ovu sliku."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:891
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "a group field stays here; a signal, if asked"
msgstr "polje grupe ostaje ovde; signal, ako se traži"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:918
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "<b>A link to a form</b> in a message shows the form's title and subtitle only to those who may open it: its members, and everyone when a public group's form takes non-members. The others see the card a guest would get, or only the link."
msgstr "<b>Link ka formi</b> u poruci pokazuje naslov i podnaslov forme samo onima koji smeju da je otvore: njenim članovima, i svima kad forma javne grupe prima i one koji nisu članovi. Ostali vide karticu koju bi dobio gost, ili samo link."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:859
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Makes the group's templates"
msgstr "Pravi šablone grupe"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:861
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Whoever may edit the group (`edit_group`), except in a direct conversation or a thread. The templates serve every group below it too, where whoever writes a description uses them but cannot change them."
msgstr "Ko sme da uređuje grupu (`edit_group`), osim u direktnom razgovoru i niti. Šabloni važe i u svakoj grupi ispod nje, gde ih koristi ko piše opis, ali ne može da ih menja."
